      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI has just unveiled its new bags for the Fall/Winter 2026 collection, the first under the creative direction of Maria Grazia Chiuri. Themed “Less I, More Us,” the season plays with a minimalist black-and-white palette, punctuated by animal prints and FF motifs that capture the house's Italian flair and feminine strength.",
