      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Magic & Roll Totes ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Magic tote is crafted from supple, durable embroidered fabric in a roomy, rectangular shopping-bag silhouette. Black trim defines its clean lines, while tubular rope handles allow for hand or shoulder carry. The unlined interior keeps it lightweight, and drawstrings at the sides add a playful touch. It comes in three versions: tobacco-brown FF jacquard, mirror-silver perforated leather, and tiger print, all finished with FENDI Stencil embroidery at the mouth and inner base for an urban edge.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
